      "content": "It sounds like you are facing profound grief over the loss of your identity and life circumstances, which is an immense burden to carry. Please try to acknowledge the reality of the pain you are feeling, even while it feels all-encompassing. Even when everything seems lost, there are people who want to help you find a path forward, and professional support can help you start rebuilding from this point. Reaching out to a local support group or therapist could offer immediate human connection.",
      "source": "target",
